Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|layout.parallel.render.enable=false|
		|extraapps.plugins.includes|content-targeting|
		|ignore.errors|IX_DC6100CC|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|false|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.component.names|Content Targeting|
		|testray.main.component.name|Content Targeting|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When Portlet shutdown Server
	And Portlet start Server
	And User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	Then Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Campaign Add Multiple With Priorities Via Campaign Display Portlet
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add CP
		|userSegmentDescription|User Segment Description Gender|
		|userSegmentName|User Segment Name Gender|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add User Attributes Gender Rule CP
		|genderRadio|Male|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add CP
		|userSegmentDescription|User Segment Description Signed In|
		|userSegmentName|User Segment Name Signed In|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add User Attributes User Signed In Rule CP
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content Low Priority|
		|webContentTitle|Low Priority Web Content Title|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And WebContent view Title
		|webContentTitle|Low Priority Web Content Title|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content Higher Priority|
		|webContentTitle|Higher Priority Web Content Title|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And WebContent view Title
		|webContentTitle|Higher Priority Web Content Title|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add CP
		|campaignDescription|Campaign Description|
		|campaignEndDate|1/1/2099|
		|campaignEndTime|12:00 PM|
		|campaignName|Low Priority Campaign Name|
		|campaignPriorityField|3|
		|campaignStartDate|1/1/2015|
		|campaignStartTime|12:00 AM|
		|userSegmentSelect|User Segment Name Gender|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Add Report
		|campaignName|Low Priority Campaign Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Report Name
		|reportDescription|Content Report Description|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Tracking Action Page CP
		|pageAlias|Page Alias|
		|pageFriendlyURL|/test-page-name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add CP
		|campaignDescription|Campaign Description High Priority|
		|campaignEndDate|1/1/2099|
		|campaignEndTime|12:00 PM|
		|campaignName|Higher Priority Campaign Name|
		|campaignPriorityField|2|
		|campaignStartDate|1/1/2015|
		|campaignStartTime|12:00 AM|
		|userSegmentSelect|User Segment Name Signed In|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Add Report
		|campaignName|Higher Priority Campaign Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Report Name
		|reportDescription|Content Report Description|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Tracking Action Page CP
		|pageAlias|Page Alias|
		|pageFriendlyURL|/test-page-name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Campaign Content Display|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And CampaignDisplayPortlet configure Campaign Rule
		|campaignName|Low Priority Campaign Name|
		|contentTitle|Low Priority Web Content Title|
		|contentType|Basic Web Content|
		|rowNumber|1|
	And CampaignDisplayPortlet configure Campaign Rule
		|campaignName|Higher Priority Campaign Name|
		|contentTitle|Higher Priority Web Content Title|
		|contentType|Basic Web Content|
		|rowNumber|2|
	And CampaignDisplayPortlet save PG
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And CampaignDisplayPortlet view PG
		|entryContentText|Web Content Content Higher Priority|
		|viewCampaignSelected|Higher Priority Campaign Name|
	Then CampaignDisplayPortlet view PG
		|previewCampaignList|Higher Priority Campaign Name,Low Priority Campaign Name,default|
