Scenario: Clustering With Content Targeting
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|app.server.bundles.size|1|
	When these properties
		|cluster.enabled|true|
	And these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	And Navigator open URL
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
	And Navigator goto Page
